        "type": "reg",
        "input": "3\n2 3\n2 4\n100 350",
        "output": "2115\n65668\n895852507",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111:\nThe pairs of points with distance 111 are:\n\n(1,1)(1, 1)(1,1) and (1,2)(1, 2)(1,2)\n(1,1)(1, 1)(1,1) and (2,1)(2, 1)(2,1)\n(1,2)(1, 2)(1,2) and (1,3)(1, 3)(1,3)\n(1,2)(1, 2)(1,2) and (2,2)(2, 2)(2,2)\n(1,3)(1, 3)(1,3) and (2,3)(2, 3)(2,3)\n(2,1)(2, 1)(2,1) and (2,2)(2, 2)(2,2)\n(2,2)(2, 2)(2,2) and (2,3)(2, 3)(2,3)\n\nThe pairs of points with distance 222 are:\n\n(1,1)(1, 1)(1,1) and (1,3)(1, 3)(1,3)\n(1,1)(1, 1)(1,1) and (2,2)(2, 2)(2,2)\n(1,2)(1, 2)(1,2) and (2,3)(2, 3)(2,3)\n(1,2)(1, 2)(1,2) and (2,1)(2, 1)(2,1)\n(1,3)(1, 3)(1,3) and (2,2)(2, 2)(2,2)\n(2,1)(2, 1)(2,1) and (2,3)(2, 3)(2,3)\n\nThe pairs of points with distance 333 are:\n\n(1,1)(1, 1)(1,1) and (2,3)(2, 3)(2,3)\n(2,1)(2, 1)(2,1) and (1,3)(1, 3)(1,3)\n\nTherefore, the answer is 7⋅310+6⋅311+2⋅3127 \\cdot 31^0 + 6 \\cdot 31^1 + 2 \\cdot 31^27⋅310+6⋅311+2⋅312 = 211521152115."
      }
